  "implementation": {
    "asset": "Distinct ideal-lever-press-points candidate: two closed colored physical pads on the same upper arm with cap/application anchors, shared fixed pivot and coincident attachment witnesses. Separate immutable metadata; strict third input branch; named saved-family example and physical camera target. Rear handle heights follow length to preserve the full admitted opening.",
